 | architecture-analyze | `<proyecto>/.architecture-clone/state.json` + `architecture-summary.md` |
 | architecture-generate | `<proyecto>/.claude/skills/<slug>-convenciones/SKILL.md` + espejo en `.opencode/skills/` |
 
